================================================================================
3. INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY NOTICE
================================================================================

This is an unofficial, non-commercial fan project. The Lord of the Rings, The
Hobbit, Middle-earth and their peoples, places and creatures were created by
J.R.R. Tolkien. This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by,
or connected to the Tolkien Estate, Middle-earth Enterprises, Embracer Group,
Warner Bros., or any film, television or game rights holder.

The MIT grant in section 1 covers only this project's own code, artwork, writing
and audio. It does not and cannot grant any rights in the Middle-earth setting
itself, and it is not a claim of ownership over any part of it.

No film footage, film or game music, actor likenesses, trademarked logos, or
assets extracted from any existing game or film have been used. Every image in
this project is generated procedurally by tools/art; every line of dialogue and
every description was written for this project.

The Ashen Regent, the twelve lesser rings, the northern valley, its settlement
and residents, and every named boss are original characters and inventions
created for this side story. The rings in this game are small hearth-craft
workings: they are not the One Ring, and they are not substitutes for or
depictions of the canonical Great Rings.

Franchise names and lore are confined to src/content so that the entire setting
can be replaced. If you are a rights holder and would like something changed or
removed, that directory is the only place you need to look.
